    "Timestamp":"2025-08-23 01:57:16",
    "Time_Period":"Fall Semester",
    "Title":"",
    "Text":"The John Lewis Student Center at Georgia Tech is one of the best places on campus for both students and visitors. The building is modern, spacious, and full of natural light, making it a comfortable spot to hang out, study, or grab food. The variety of dining options is a big plus\u2014you can find everything from quick snacks to full meals\u2014and the layout makes it easy to settle in with friends or work on group projects. It also hosts plenty of events, so there\u2019s always something happening that adds to the energy of the space. The tribute to John Lewis adds a meaningful touch, reminding everyone of his legacy of leadership and service. It really feels like a hub for campus life.",
    "Star_Rating":5,
    "Author":"Subhajit Bag",
    "School":"Georgia Tech",
    "Location":"Student Center",
